                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Really weird game. It's a corridor shooter aiming for a cinematic/psychological sort of angle, but it's far, far too restrictive for it's own good.\n\nLike I played Fear, and it's successor, Trepang recently, and I feel like those games do everything this game did waaayyy better.\n\nI found the story and characters to be uninteresting, personally. I think the level design and bolted-down nature of the game hurts it majorly.\n\nHalf this game is basically a really boring forced stealth mission.",
